[17]={"Usa [Untapped Dowsing Widget] en el estanque de Sandsorrow Watch. Evita los Sandfury Trolls élite de camino","Aparecerán dos Centipaar Tunnelers 47/48 al llenar [Untapped Dowsing Widget]; mátalos o huye para reiniciarlos"},
[19]={"Mata Centipaar Sandreavers, Swarmers, Stingers, Tunnelers y Wasps. Despoja Centipaar Insect Parts","Ojo: todos lanzan [Thrash]; Sandreavers [Arcing Smash], Swarmers [Silithid Swarm] (muere con AoE), Stingers [Venom Sting], Tunnelers [Pierce Armor] y Wasps [Poison]."},
